2. Data in data/
   -------------
data/data_v1.0.csv and data/data_v2.0.csv are taken from:

  L. Gomes, Z. Vale, P. Faria, J. Soares. 2025 Competition on Electric Energy
  Consumption Forecast Adopting Multi-criteria Performance Metrics (v4.5.1).
  GECAD, Polytechnic Institute of Porto. Zenodo, 2025.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16061225

and are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

Changes made: the published files data_v1.0.xlsx and data_v2.0.xlsx were
exported to CSV. No values were altered. Timestamps are assigned by the
notebooks (v1.0 starting 2023-12-01, v2.0 starting 2024-12-01).
